{"id": "16-1720-2-4", "zh": "pañha 根，用于“想要知道”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1720-5-6", "zh": "pañhati（想要知道）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1720-7-8", "zh": "pañho（问题）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1720-9-16", "zh": "这里的 **pañho**，是指想要知道的事情。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1720-17-26", "zh": "这里的词源解释是：它被人提问，被人想要知道，所以叫作 **pañho**。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1720-27-51", "zh": "所以，解释《导论》圣典中“当问题被解答时”这句话的意思时，注释者说：“**pañhe**，是指在想要知道的事情上。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1721-2-4", "zh": "miha 根，用于“洒、浇”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1721-5-8", "zh": "mihati（洒），ummihati（小便）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1721-9-12", "zh": "megho（云），mehanaṃ（阴部）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1722-2-7", "zh": "其中，**ummihatī** 的意思是小便。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1722-8-17", "zh": "**megho**：它用一道道雨水浇洒世间，所以叫作 megho，也就是雨云。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1722-18-22", "zh": "mehanaṃ 是指女性的隐秘部位。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1723-2-6", "zh": "daha 根，用于“烧成灰”和“认作、持有”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1723-7-10", "zh": "火焚烧房屋。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1723-11-22", "zh": "“这个男人把这个女人 dahati 为祖母”，意思是他认定她是“我的祖母”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1723-23-30", "zh": "用意是：这个女人是这个男人的祖母。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1723-31-46", "zh": "这里有这样一句圣典：“安巴塔，释迦族人奉甘蔗王为祖先。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1723-47-54", "zh": "被火烧毁的房屋；dayhati（被烧），dayhamānaṃ（正在被烧的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1723-55-66", "zh": "如果把 d 替换为 ḍ，就得到 ḍahati 这个形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1723-67-81", "zh": "“它烧灼着愚人，紧随不舍，就像被灰掩盖的火”这类用例，就是这里的例证。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1724-2-4", "zh": "caha 根，用于“努力、奔走”义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1724-5-6", "zh": "cahati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1725-2-4", "zh": "raha 根，用于“舍弃”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1725-5-6", "zh": "rahati（舍弃）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1725-7-10", "zh": "raho（隐处），rahito（远离的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1726-2-4", "zh": "rahi 根，用于“行走”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1726-5-6", "zh": "rahati（行走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1726-7-10", "zh": "raho、rahaṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1727-2-6", "zh": "dahi、bahi 根，用于“增长”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1727-7-8", "zh": "dahati（增长）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1727-9-10", "zh": "bahati（增长）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1728-2-5", "zh": "bahi 根也用于“声音”义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1728-6-9", "zh": "ca 字照应前面的“增长”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1728-10-11", "zh": "bahati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1729-2-5", "zh": "tuhi、duhi 根，用于“伤害”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1729-6-7", "zh": "tuhati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1729-8-9", "zh": "duhati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1730-2-5", "zh": "araha、maha 根，用于“供养、尊敬”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1730-6-7", "zh": "arahati（值得供养）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1730-8-11", "zh": "arahaṃ、arahā（阿罗汉）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1730-12-13", "zh": "mahati（供奉）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1731-2-5", "zh": "mahanaṃ、maho（供奉、庆典）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1731-6-7", "zh": "寺院庆典。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1731-8-9", "zh": "塔庙庆典。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1732-2-13", "zh": "其中，阿罗汉因为没有烦恼，是完全值得布施的人，能让别人对他所作的供养、恭敬等获得大果报，所以值得供养、值得尊敬，因此称为 arahā，也就是漏尽者。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1733-2-4", "zh": "īha 根，用于“努力”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1733-5-6", "zh": "īhati（努力）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1733-7-8", "zh": "īhā（努力）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1733-9-12", "zh": "īhā 是指精进。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1734-2-5", "zh": "vaha、maha 根，用于“增长”义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1734-6-9", "zh": "vahati、mahati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1735-2-5", "zh": "ahi、pilahi 根，用于“行走”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1735-6-7", "zh": "ahati（行走）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1735-8-11", "zh": "pilahati；ahi（蛇）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1736-2-13", "zh": "这里的 **ahī**（蛇）虽然没有脚，却能 ahati，也就是行走、能够移动，所以叫作 ahi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1737-2-5", "zh": "garaha、kalaha 根，用于“谴责、轻视”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1737-6-7", "zh": "garahati（谴责）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1737-8-13", "zh": "garahā（谴责），kalahati（争吵），kalaho（争吵）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1738-2-7", "zh": "varaha、valaha 根，用于“为首”义，也用于“斥责、伤害、给予”义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1738-8-9", "zh": "varahati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1738-10-11", "zh": "valahati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1738-12-13", "zh": "varāho（猪、象）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1739-2-9", "zh": "这里的 **varāho**，既指猪，也指大象。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1739-10-18", "zh": "例如在“羚羊与野猪”，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1739-19-33", "zh": "“像吃饲料养肥的大猪”等句子中，猪被称为“varāho”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1739-34-55", "zh": "而在“大象在河里警醒，啃食着莲藕”等句子中，大象被称为“varāho”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1739-56-61", "zh": "因为 **mahāvarāhassā** 的意思是“大象的”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1740-2-6", "zh": "vehu、jehu、vāhu 根，用于“努力”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1740-7-10", "zh": "vehati、jehati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1740-11-12", "zh": "vāhati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1740-13-14", "zh": "vāhano（马）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1741-2-6", "zh": "vāhano 是指马。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1741-7-21", "zh": "因为在战斗等事情发生时，人们凭借它 vāhanti，也就是努力、发起精进，所以它被称为 **vāhano**。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1742-2-4", "zh": "dāhu 根，用于“睡意消退”义。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1742-5-6", "zh": "dāhati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1743-2-4", "zh": "ūha 根，用于“思考”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1743-5-13", "zh": "ūhati、āyūhati、viyūhati、byūhati、apohati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1743-14-21", "zh": "ūhanaṃ（思考）、āyūhanaṃ（积聚）、byūho（阵列）、apoho（排除）。", "confidence": 70}
